  2024 Table 1: 22 provinces adding to 10,185,363, the printed national total
  2024 Provincial Snapshots: 96 districts across 22 provinces
  2011 Summary Indicators: 22 provinces, and the three the report names in prose (Bougainville, Morobe, Northern) agree with it
  religion coverage: one denomination per province, describing 19.7% of Hela at the least and 68.4% of Autonomous Region of Bougainville at the most; all 22 below 95.0%, so every panel says what share it describes
